      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/IanBegley/status/2042998946616783002",
      "reply_text": "That's a lot of 'ifs'. Hawks have been inconsistent all season.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T17:34:31.824952+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/JeffJSays/status/2042967061215793510",
      "reply_text": "Not by much though. West still has some strong teams.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T17:35:15.842832+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/NBAdoPovo/status/2042980426810089816",
      "reply_text": "Fair point on the awards, but the 65-game rule's more about tanking prevention than reflecting impact.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T17:35:52.942966+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/NBACobwebs/status/2042977133971018191",
      "reply_text": "Classic Magic. Unstoppable even back then.",
