    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Fried_Baseball/status/2042977557755174986",
      "reply_text": "Fair point. He's been dominating games all season.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T17:37:51.462660+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/GrantAfseth/status/2043004104335565268",
      "reply_text": "Interesting combo. Fudd's shooting and Bueckers' playmaking could be a good mix.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T17:46:54.741974+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/LakintwoGDF/status/2042977016782172458",
      "reply_text": "Load management already? They're 1st seed and still 20 games left.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T17:47:48.555786+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/PichuRuas/status/2042991053523890356",
      "reply_text": "Good for him and his family. Hope the recovery goes smoothly.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T17:58:42.955552+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/RealBobManning/status/2042976645682753755",
      "reply_text": "That's a lot of 'ifs'.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T17:59:38.217370+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/StoolGreenie/status/2042993553010524527",
      "reply_text": "That's the Brad Stevens magic. Unbeatable in the regular season",
